        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant\n- Products: floating nuclear power station\n- People: Mikhail Lomonosov\n- Events: shutdown plans, replacement\n\nFacts:\n- Plans were announced to begin a shutdown procedure for the Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant in 2019.\n- The Bilibino Nuclear Power Plant was to be replaced by a floating nuclear power station.\n- The floating nuclear power station was named after Mikhail Lomonosov.\n- Mikhail Lomonosov was the Russian credited with discovering the atmosphere of Venus.",
